{"id":"n69449-1-9","stage":3,"title":"우기다 · 强硬要求","scene":"社会与交往","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n69449-1-9-1","ko":"너 왜 자꾸 내 책을 네 책이라고 우기냐?","zh":"你为什么一直坚称我的书是你的书呢？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"너","meaning":"你","explanation":"너：你","readings":[{"term":"너","audio":"/audio/734dae8e9d9a8f8b763b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"64390","senseId":"1","lemma":"너","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"왜","meaning":"为什么","explanation":"왜：为什么","readings":[{"term":"왜","audio":"/audio/08b35eb63efd4aaae44c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"67848","senseId":"1","lemma":"왜","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"자꾸","meaning":"一直，总是","explanation":"자꾸：一直，总是","readings":[{"term":"자꾸","audio":"/audio/d28ff63a0382ce4fce6d.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"70796","senseId":"1","lemma":"자꾸","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"내","meaning":"我","explanation":"나：我；의：所属、关联或修饰，常对应“的”。","readings":[{"term":"나","audio":"/audio/1098bbe54520ab2a367c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"60931","senseId":"1","lemma":"나","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"책을","meaning":"书，书籍，画册","explanation":"책：书，书籍，画册；을：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"책","audio":"/audio/ba928dd573a2db9e7579.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71468","senseId":"1","lemma":"책","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"네","meaning":"“너의(你的)”的缩略语。","explanation":"네：“너의(你的)”的缩略语。","readings":[{"term":"네","audio":"/audio/1c0ddfd0050938404c35.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"84427","senseId":"1","lemma":"네","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"책이라고","meaning":"书，书籍，画册","explanation":"책：书，书籍，画册；이다：表示“是”的判断形式。；라고：引用命令或名词判断；要与前后引用表达连用。","readings":[{"term":"책","audio":"/audio/ba928dd573a2db9e7579.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71468","senseId":"1","lemma":"책","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"우기냐?","meaning":"强硬要求，硬来","explanation":"우기다：强硬要求，硬来；냐：非敬语疑问句末，用于亲近的人、晚辈或自问。","readings":[{"term":"우기다","audio":"/audio/77f70fdd88233e534b48.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"69449","senseId":"1","lemma":"우기다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"734dae8e9d9a8f8b","term":"너","zh":"你","audio":"/audio/734dae8e9d9a8f8b763b.mp3","entryId":"64390","definition":"指代听者，用于朋友或晚辈。","pronunciation":["너"]},{"id":"08b35eb63efd4aaa","term":"왜","zh":"为什么","audio":"/audio/08b35eb63efd4aaae44c.mp3","entryId":"67848","definition":"因什么原因；或指怎么。","pronunciation":["왜ː"]},{"id":"d28ff63a0382ce4f","term":"자꾸","zh":"一直，总是","audio":"/audio/d28ff63a0382ce4fce6d.mp3","entryId":"70796","definition":"多次连续地。","pronunciation":["자꾸"]},{"id":"1098bbe54520ab2a","term":"나","zh":"我","audio":"/audio/1098bbe54520ab2a367c.mp3","entryId":"60931","definition":"说话人在朋友或晚辈面前用来指称自己。","pronunciation":["나"]},{"id":"ba928dd573a2db9e","term":"책","zh":"书，书籍，画册","audio":"/audio/ba928dd573a2db9e7579.mp3","entryId":"71468","definition":"把文章或画印刷之后装订成册而成的物品。","pronunciation":["책"]},{"id":"1c0ddfd005093840","term":"네","zh":"“너의(你的)”的缩略语。","audio":"/audio/1c0ddfd0050938404c35.mp3","entryId":"84427","definition":"“너의(你的)”的缩略语。","pronunciation":[]},{"id":"77f70fdd88233e53","term":"우기다","zh":"强硬要求，硬来","audio":"/audio/77f70fdd88233e534b48.mp3","entryId":"69449","definition":"不讲理而固执地主张自己的意见或意思。","pronunciation":["우기다"]}],"audio":"/audio/7842a5f747ce968655d2.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n69449-1-9-2","ko":"여기에 네 것이라는 표시라도 있어?","zh":"这里有写着是你的东西吗？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"여기에","meaning":"这里，这儿","explanation":"여기：这里，这儿；에：格助词，表示时间、位置、去向、对象等；需结合整句理解。","readings":[{"term":"여기","audio":"/audio/c13089162f79c61744a9.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"17863","senseId":"1","lemma":"여기","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"네","meaning":"你","explanation":"너：你；의：所属、关联或修饰，常对应“的”。","readings":[{"term":"너","audio":"/audio/734dae8e9d9a8f8b763b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"64390","senseId":"1","lemma":"너","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"것이라는","meaning":"(某人)的","explanation":"것：(某人)的；이다：表示“是”的判断形式。；라는：引用名词判断、名称或命令内容并修饰后面的名词。","readings":[{"term":"것","audio":"/audio/1443a6c090b122289ad7.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62835","senseId":"3","lemma":"것","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"표시라도","meaning":"标，标明，标记","explanation":"표시：标，标明，标记；이다：表示“是”的判断形式。；라도：表示让步或假定：“即使是、就算是”。","readings":[{"term":"표시","audio":"/audio/487749b84d4d7f4ffe8e.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"88633","senseId":"1","lemma":"표시","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"있어?","meaning":"有","explanation":"있다：有；어：非敬语句末；与熟悉的人或晚辈交谈，语调决定陈述、询问等语气。","readings":[{"term":"있다","audio":"/audio/96fe52db2531c9e73e53.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"68797","senseId":"2","lemma":"있다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"c13089162f79c617","term":"여기","zh":"这里，这儿","audio":"/audio/c13089162f79c61744a9.mp3","entryId":"17863","definition":"指代与说话人较近的地方。","pronunciation":["여기"]},{"id":"734dae8e9d9a8f8b","term":"너","zh":"你","audio":"/audio/734dae8e9d9a8f8b763b.mp3","entryId":"64390","definition":"指代听者，用于朋友或晚辈。","pronunciation":["너"]},{"id":"1443a6c090b12228","term":"것","zh":"(某人)的","audio":"/audio/1443a6c090b122289ad7.mp3","entryId":"62835","definition":"表示某人的所有物。","pronunciation":["걷"]},{"id":"487749b84d4d7f4f","term":"표시","zh":"标，标明，标记","audio":"/audio/487749b84d4d7f4ffe8e.mp3","entryId":"88633","definition":"标出某一告知内容，以示于人。","pronunciation":["표시"]},{"id":"96fe52db2531c9e7","term":"있다","zh":"有","audio":"/audio/96fe52db2531c9e73e53.mp3","entryId":"68797","definition":"事实或现象存在。","pronunciation":["읻따"]}],"audio":"/audio/01dd5b421a7d2cf12078.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":2.815,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=69449","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"sourceSenseId":"1","sourceLevel":"중급","day":99,"sequenceScore":2.6417,"questions":[{"lineIndex":0,"options":["这里有写着是你的东西吗？","每当智英用带着笑意的声音和我说话时，我的心就会颤抖。","你为什么一直坚称我的书是你的书呢？"],"answer":2},{"lineI